  "views": {
    "hero": "side",
    "reads": {
      "front": "Static crackles over the caster on the near side; the bolt shoots away from the camera, foreshortened to a jagged flash with forks, and the target lights up with sparks and a flash at the far end.",
      "side": "Hero view. Static snapping over the caster's body, then one thick jagged bolt from hand to the target's chest with a fork or two, re-striking twice, sparks bursting off the target and a ring on the ground under it.",
      "top": "A jagged line from the caster to the target that flickers twice; the ground story carries it: static around the caster's feet during the charge, then a ring, sparks fanning out and a scorch with glowing cracks under the target.",
      "three_quarter": "The bolt reads as a jagged line slanting from hand to target with its forks in depth; the body static, the burst at the target and the scorch all read."
    }
  },
